  "player_text": "I pause between the stacks and look at the nearest guard, noting where their eyes go and whether their hand is on a weapon, then ask quietly if anyone passed through the yards since the notice went up.",
  "visible_motivation": "The mud and straw show nothing, but the guards are watching this yard in a silence that does not match ordinary wagon traffic.",
  "intended_meaning": "I want to see whether the guards are watching the crates or watching me, and whether they saw anyone use this track.",
